[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16081.11, "timestamp": "04:28:01", "text": "不想让他们强迫自己"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16083.91, "timestamp": "04:28:03", "text": "比如来看我的直播什么的。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16087.91, "timestamp": "04:28:07", "text": "呃，我这么做是有具体原因的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16091.269, "timestamp": "04:28:11", "text": "需要版主。那只是为了应对"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16093.91, "timestamp": "04:28:13", "text": "人们呃，你知道在某些粘性"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16096.309, "timestamp": "04:28:16", "text": "棘手的情况。除此之外，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16097.75, "timestamp": "04:28:17", "text": "无需实际登机。有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16099.91, "timestamp": "04:28:19", "text": "没有其他船只可以登船了。大部分东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16101.75, "timestamp": "04:28:21", "text": "一切都是自动化的。你没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16103.75, "timestamp": "04:28:23", "text": "需要做宣传或任何花哨的事情吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16106.229, "timestamp": "04:28:26", "text": "就是这样。你可以放松一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16108.389, "timestamp": "04:28:28", "text": "吃药放松一下。什么也没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16112.229, "timestamp": "04:28:32", "text": "有很多事要做，因为我做出了终极版"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16115.83, "timestamp": "04:28:35", "text": "终极聊天记录以及所有那些……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16118.309, "timestamp": "04:28:38", "text": "YouTube 和 YouTube 的外部内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16121.429, "timestamp": "04:28:41", "text": "Twitch，这样你就可以安心坐着了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16123.189, "timestamp": "04:28:43", "text": "喝口咖啡，然后就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16126.51, "timestamp": "04:28:46", "text": "请查看Discord服务器的模组。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16129.429, "timestamp": "04:28:49", "text": "它包揽一切恶作剧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16132.95, "timestamp": "04:28:52", "text": "正在发生的事件。哦，是啊，我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16135.349, "timestamp": "04:28:55", "text": "呃，想用它做更多的事情。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16137.83, "timestamp": "04:28:57", "text": "知道。我好像有了些新的想